WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.970
What? Haruto?

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.970
Asahi?

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.350
Why are you just standing there?

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.020
No way. You're not supposed to be here.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.560
You're acting weird.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.350
Haruto?

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.320
Are you really Asahi?

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.880
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:03.950
Untold Feelings

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.960
I don't really get it,
but we completed the quest.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:12.960
We're lucky!

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.550
-That was easy!
-Right.

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:20.590
All right. We're going to go report to the guild,
so you can go now.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.930
Haruto, who are they?

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.810
Hey, Haruto. What's wrong?

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:30.600
Hey!

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:33.110
You're an imposter, aren't you.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.610
An imposter?

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.740
Are you playing a shapeshifting game with Clive?

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.570
I want to play too!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.240
There's no way you're Asahi!

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:49.000
Why not?
You're not acting like yourself today, Haruto.

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.250
No! No way!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.550
Six years ago, you--

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.050
-Hey. Is that...?
-It's someone else.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.010
The friend she's with is also...?

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.390
-Let's go.
-Haruto?

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:13.810
Haruto, you're acting really weird.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:19.150
No. I'm not the one who's being weird.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:24.160
Let me ask you something.
Where are you logged in from?

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:27.490
My room. Like always.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.790
Where were you these last six years?
What were you doing?

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.000
Six years? What do you mean?

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.380
I played with you guys just yesterday.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:41.300
-We went to the pool yesterday.
-The pool?

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:46.060
Nozomi, that was pretty crazy yesterday.
Are you okay now?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.430
Yeah.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.640
-Did something happen?
-We went to the pool yesterday.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.940
Nozomi got a cramp and almost drowned.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.440
That was close.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.860
Right.
Nozomi got a cramp and almost drowned.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.200
You guys saved her.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:09.080
She told us to keep it a secret,
or else her mother would worry.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:10.750
She almost cried.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.620
And...

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.710
What year is it now?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.550
It's 2034, right?

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.840
It's 2040 now.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.800
You're kidding me.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.510
If you think I'm lying, go check for yourself.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.430
Geez, are you trying to scare me?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.440
July 26, 2040.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:38.730
What? Is it a bug?

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.730
You-- Six years ago today--

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:44.530
Maybe the bug will go away if I log in again.
I'm going to log out.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.740
LOGOUT

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.240
What?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.490
I can't logout.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.870
How about you?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.380
Why?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.010
Well, if I can't logout...

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.880
She's so relaxed. She hasn't changed.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.140
Hey, do something, Haruto.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.850
What am I supposed to do?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:13.140
All we can do is contact the operator.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.770
ASAHI KUGA'S ACCOUNT IS NOT REGISTERED

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:22.110
Not registered? What do you mean?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.530
This is bad.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.240
Where's everyone else? Where's Satsuki and Takanori?

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.120
Did they login yet?

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.790
I don't know.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.040
What do you mean you don't know?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.540
Things aren't the same as back then.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.040
Back then?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.670
You died six years ago!

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:54.060
You're kidding. I can't be dead.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.190
I'm here right now.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.810
I don't understand it either.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.230
I can't believe it.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.700
You really are Asahi from Subaru.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:11.580
That means the rumors you died were fake.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:14.240
-Who are you?
-Did you forget him?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.710
He used to mess with you,
but now you would kill him in an instant.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.090
-I don't remember.
-I'm Leonovitch!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:30.090
Just so you know.
I'm not the same guy I used to be!

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.430
Of course! Even Haruto can see that!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:36.600
-Right?
-No-- I--

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:41.270
Asahi, your Prophet Art is a strong ability.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.610
Join us.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.070
There you go again.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:49.110
I already have my friends from Subaru.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.160
When are you talking about?

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.620
Subaru doesn't exist anymore.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.080
Of course it exists!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.710
Right, Haruto?

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.630
Why are you being quiet?

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.380
Say something!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.880
Hey. Are you fighting amongst yourselves?

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:07.380
Knock it off!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.630
I don't believe you!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:12.970
I don't care if you believe me or not.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:16.220
Haruto, let's blow him away like usual.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:19.350
Just try.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.270
Haruto?

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.990
Haruto, you've lost your Sense!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:33.070
You're no different from any random guy on the street.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.740
-I'll back you up.
-Stay back!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:46.130
Asahi, if you're not going to join us,
then I'll start off with a "game over" for him!

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.430
Haruto, duck!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.350
-Seriously?
-She can see the future.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:05.940
So that's the Prophet Art!

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:09.150
This is so nostalgic.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:13.070
Your power tripped us up many times.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.320
You really are the real--?

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:21.080
What? I can't see it. This never happened before.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:25.330
I'm going to pay you back a hundred times over
for six years ago!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:26.630
Run, Asahi.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:31.720
But if I do--
I have to keep my promise to you.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:35.640
If you bow down and apologize, I'll forgive you.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:41.100
-But you'll have to become my followers.
-Never!

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.350
-Really?
-You bastard.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.980
Who do you think you are?

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.110
Takanori!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.910
Well? Are you going to fight a battle you can't win?

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.540
-Coward.
-Teleporting with the Divinity Sense?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.330
-They're from that guild.
-Illuminati!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.000
You...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.420
Breaker.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:16.970
A coward like you doesn't need clothes.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.680
Damn it! Retreat!

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:23.600
Takanori, you'll pay for this!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.480
You've lost your Sense.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.940
Too bad, ex-leader.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.820
I doubted it at first.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.070
But I'm happy to see you again,

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:37.910
Asahi.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.830
I see. I understand the situation.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.580
Leave it to me.

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.920
You don't doubt me?

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.880
I've never doubted you before.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.970
Thank you. We'll do our best together, the three of us!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.800
No. We don't need Haruto.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.590
What? Why?

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.560
He knows why.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.560
Asahi, you watched the battle just now, right?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.940
-But--
-Even if he came with us,

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.360
it would just be game over for him someday.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.610
How can you say that?

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.860
Why aren't you saying anything, Haruto?

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.190
Hey!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.240
Takanori, don't you think this is weird?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:24.080
How can you accept the situation so easily?

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.040
Asahi is standing right in front of me.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.500
I have no reason to doubt her.

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:34.130
-You were there too! Back there, Asahi--
-I don't want to argue with you.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:37.630
Are you trying to get me to say
the same thing I did back then?

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:40.720
You killed Asahi!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:46.350
What's wrong? Why are you two fighting?

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:53.730
If we're not bringing Haruto, then I'm not going either.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:58.240
I see.
You'll find out how powerless he is before long.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.660
Asahi...

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:05.120
If you need my help, call me any time.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.450
I won't let you down.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.040
No matter what it takes.

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:15.130
What's gotten into Takanori?

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.300
Everything has changed since six years ago.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.800
-Even me.
-But we made a promise.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.640
A promise?

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:30.100
Everything ended when we failed
the quest six years ago.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.940
I haven't spoken to Takanori for six years.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.900
Everyone is gone.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.610
And Subaru...

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:40.700
-Subaru really doesn't exist anymore?
-Yeah.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:44.240
Asahi?

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:48.080
Then we have to make it again!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.790
Subaru is where we all belong!

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.580
Everyone is supposed to come back here.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.670
Because we are Subaru!

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.980
KUGA FAMILY

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.400
THE GIRL WHO SEES THE STARS END
END CHRONICLE

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.980
ASAHI KUGA

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:19.030
Coming!

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:28.540
She really is the Asahi I know... we know.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.450
But...

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.540
You've got a guest! She's amazing!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:34.960
Who is it?

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.420
Hurry! Hurry!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.670
It's been a while, Haruto.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.430
Satsuki! You-- Are you Satsuki?

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:50.100
What are you talking about?
I'm your childhood friend.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:52.480
Come in, Satsuki.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:56.100
No thanks. I just stopped by to ask you something.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.810
Don't worry!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.360
You're so loud. Leave us alone.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:03.650
-Okay!
-Well...

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.360
Come in.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.240
We haven't seen each since elementary school.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.330
-Yeah. I'll get a seat.
-It's okay.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:18.040
Can I sit here?
I used to sit here all the time.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.220
Thanks for what you did back then.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.260
You stood up for me to the end.

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:27.260
Everyone understands.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:30.260
Takanori said some things, but even he...

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:35.810
I thought you'd never come back.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:37.810
What are you talking about?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.570
I saw you in front of the inn yesterday.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.570
Satsuki, you play Re'Union?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.030
It took some courage at first.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.070
I had good memories.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:52.160
I tried to talk to you, but you logged out.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.120
But...

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.210
I'm glad.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.210
Did you see who I was with?

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:04.510
A reunion with a childhood friend.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.340
How nice! I wonder what they're talking about.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.100
I can't believe it.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.260
I can't believe it either.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.100
So, what did you do?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:17.600
I told her to wait in front of the inn, and came back.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.610
You left her there?

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:24.900
What else was I supposed to do?

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:30.620
I never planned on returning to that world.
I'll let Takanori handle this.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.620
That's not like you, Haruto.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:37.160
-Asahi said the same thing.
-What?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.710
Anyway, I'm not going back.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:44.130
I wanted it to be game over so I could delete my ID.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.840
I want to cut all ties and erase all my memories.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.390
Including your memories with us? Everything?

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.010
And you think you can run away
from the past by doing that?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.060
They're quiet now.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.360
But I bet he doesn't have the guts to--

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.240
Bye!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.950
What did you do?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.800
Satsuki!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.350
Hi!

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.810
No way-- You really are...

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:42.190
What?
You look different from the other day.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.560
Did Clive do that?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:46.610
I'm jealous.

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.900
Oh, right! We haven't seen each other for six years!

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.240
It doesn't feel that way.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.910
You don't look that surprised.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:59.540
Well, it's the truth.
There's no point thinking about it.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.920
You haven't changed, Asahi.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.710
Haruto said the same thing.

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.710
Do you...

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.550
know that you're dead?

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:10.720
Satsuki!

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.130
If I don't tell her that, how can we talk?

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:17.560
Haruto said that too.
Your jokes aren't funny, Satsuki.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:21.060
Then what have you been doing for six years?

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.310
What's your last memory?

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.820
I defended Haruto.

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:30.440
Yeah. We failed the quest.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.070
When we logged out, you were dead.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:37.080
-I even went to your funeral.
-Wait...

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.330
I'm not dead. I'm right here.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.210
You can't logout, right?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.830
You don't have a body to return to. That's why.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.840
You're so mean, Satsuki.
How can you say that?

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.880
What do you want me to do?

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:55.680
I've never forgotten about you these last six years!

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:58.140
I visited your grave every year!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.720
If you really are alive,

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:03.350
then why didn't you show up in real life?

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:06.770
-Satsuki...
-If you're going to be with us forever,

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.690
I don't care if you're just data.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.820
But you might be a bug.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.860
You could disappear at any moment.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:18.620
I don't want to go through the same thing again.
I can't take it.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:20.990
I'm not dead.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.160
I'm right here.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.330
Why won't you believe me, Satsuki?

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.590
Enemies!

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.470
The Prophet Art is ours!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:42.140
There are always guys like this.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:45.890
We're only interested in the Prophet Art.
Get rid of them!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.820
We were talking about something important.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.280
If you value your life...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.400
leave us be.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.910
There are so many.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:18:00.830
You can only summon two elementals with magic!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.290
No way! Subaru's Innocensia?

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.290
The Queen of Elementals!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:07.330
You're pretty slow.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:12.460
You made me mad,
so there's nowhere for you to run now.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.840
Go back to the real world forever.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:17.800
Take them away, Vatical!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.930
Flames of Eternal Dominion!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.680
Shoot, Aerie!

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:25.180
Threads of Blue Steel!

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:28.520
Sorry.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:31.440
I never forgive anyone who threatens me.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.270
Earthen Fortress!

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.910
Green Oppression!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.050
You're always so merciless.

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.760
You look good holding a whip.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:59.760
Don't tell her that.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.890
This isn't a good place to talk.

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.640
Let's go to our base.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.270
The guys who attacked first were wiped out.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:11.940
So the Queen joined Asahi.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:14.570
Form a search party.

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:17.070
Kill anyone who gets in the way.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.610
Just capture Asahi.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:21.870
Lightning can't capture Asahi.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.450
-Illuminati?
-Takanori?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:27.700
I'm warning you.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:40.220
If your guild does anything to Asahi,

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:45.220
we're going to crush you all, no matter what.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:48.020
Stop!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:51.230
I promise! I promise I'll never touch Asahi!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.520
-Forgive me!
-The information's spreading too fast.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.360
Who's behind it?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.860
It's still here.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.870
Why?

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.870
My items are gone.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.370
I have to collect them all again.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.630
It was left here?

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.250
I got this from you.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.260
I was hoping you'd wear it.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:24.640
There wasn't a good way to use it in that quest.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.260
I was hoping you'd wear it anyway.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.640
Nothing.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:33.900
I wonder if there's anything lying around on the ground...

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.480
Stop that! You look pitiful.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.990
-What's this?
-What did you find?

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.910
You can't look. I found it.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:47.410
-It might have been something I dropped.
-It's not.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.040
What are we supposed to do now?

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:00.420
-Hey.
-Who's there?

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:09.930
-Is she after Asahi?
-No.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:14.310
I'm Elicia.
I'm not one of the attackers.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:18.110
She read my thoughts. She's an empath.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:22.400
Right. Empaths can read people's thoughts.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:26.820
Reading people's thoughts
is the same as seeing the future.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:31.330
But her ability to see the future
works on things other than people.

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:34.960
-Like the future of objects.
-What are you trying to say?

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.710
To be precise,

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:40.710
the ability to see the future isn't the same
as the Empath Sense.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:46.840
Her Sense isn't one of the six types
of Senses that are defined in this world.

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:49.350
No way.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.220
They are people planning an attack from the shadows.

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:56.940
To awaken her Sense.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.600
Awaken her Sense?

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:01.610
The big guilds are already on the move.

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:03.990
Protect Asahi.

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:05.990
Wait! Who are you?

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:09.990
You... All of you must remember.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.740
Face it, Haruto Amo.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.540
Face your past.

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:24.010
My past?

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:56.970
Are you really Asahi?

00:23:57.140 --> 00:23:58.560
You too, Satsuki?

00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:00.020
Do you have proof?

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:03.730
I'll show you the mole on the inside of my thigh.

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.440
Episode 3, "The Promise."

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:09.740
-Or the mole on my butt Haruto found?
-What?
